WEBVTT

NOTE CineReels — Revenge of the God of Waves — Episode 3 — English subtitles — translation of the actual spoken Arabic dialogue (language: en)
NOTE Transcribed 2026-11-24 from the real episode audio (whisper-small + manual cleanup).

1
00:00:20.940 --> 00:00:24.100
I can't believe she's marrying a sponge surfer.

2
00:00:25.380 --> 00:00:27.060
Give him what he deserves.

3
00:00:39.370 --> 00:00:40.730
We look lovely together.

4
00:00:41.650 --> 00:00:44.130
If you hadn't worn that shirt…

5
00:00:44.570 --> 00:00:49.020
Someone called you the sponge surfer.

6
00:00:50.100 --> 00:00:52.580
I thought you didn't care that I don't surf.

7
00:00:52.580 --> 00:00:53.460
I don't.

8
00:00:54.060 --> 00:00:55.060
I don't care.

9
00:00:55.660 --> 00:00:56.700
A strange warning.

10
00:00:56.700 --> 00:00:57.900
She cared.

11
00:00:58.220 --> 00:01:00.420
And that wasn't her only complaint against me.

12
00:01:00.420 --> 00:01:03.380
But I made a promise to stay with her for five years.

13
00:01:03.460 --> 00:01:05.540
And I was determined to keep that promise.

14
00:01:05.540 --> 00:01:07.100
No matter how hard it was.

15
00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:08.700
And it was extremely hard.
